| greedyC (not delivered) | 57/365 | ≈ xs | ≈ xs | ≈ xs | ≈ xs | ≈ xs |

\* excluding C6H6 (see §6); including benzene the maxima are 48.8 % (lite) and
151 % (xs). † xsc4 extended matrix covers C0–C4 fuels only (aromatic cases are
outside its scope by construction).

Per-fuel detail (max |error|):

**lite** — IDT: H2 0.1 %, CH4 0.2 %, C2H4 2.0 %, C2H6 2.7 %, C3H8 6.4 %,
C4H10 14.0 %, CO 0.1 %, CH3OH 0.1 %, iC4H10 12.0 %, C2H2 19.1 %, C6H5CH3 20.3 %,
