C2H4 3.6, CH3OH 0.2, C3H6 3.6, C2H2 15.3 cm/s (11.5 %).

**xs** — IDT: H2 0.1 %, CH4 3.8 %, C2H4 3.8 %, C2H6 4.0 %, C3H8 23.8 %,
C4H10 23.2 %, CO 0.1 %, CH3OH 1.4 %, C2H2 23.8 %, iC4H10 24.0 %, C3H6 57.0 %,
C6H5CH3 45.5 %, C6H6 151 %. SL: H2 ≈0, CH4 3.3, C2H4 3.2, C2H6 3.8, C3H8 6.6,
